OL,3,GNEWSAMen's Shed seeks new home due to
OL,4,Acollege space loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that provides a community
OL,7,Fwoodworking workshop is looking to find
OL,8,Fa new home as its current space at a
OL,9,Fcollege is needed to make room for more
OL,10,Fstudents.
OL,12,FDorchester Men's Shed has been based at
OL,13,FKingston Maurward College near
OL,14,FDorchester for nearly 10 years.
OL,16,FThe shed's secretary, Andrew Rennison,
OL,17,Fsaid the college had been "fantastic"
OL,18,Fproviding the space to the charity at a
OL,19,Fpeppercorn rent but "we just don't fit
OL,20,Fthere any more and they need the room
OL,21,Fthey have kindly given us for their
OL,22,Fstudents".
